# The doc tools (`just docs`, `just docs-lint`, the CI unit job): what they need, by name.
# requirements.txt beside this is compiled from it and is what is installed, every version
# exact, into a venv of their own (.build/docs-venv), constrained by the tool's own lock so
# ansible-core is the version the tool runs (antsibull-docs reads the docs through ansible-doc):
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.12 docs/tools/requirements.in \
#     -c requirements.txt -o docs/tools/requirements.txt
# A bump is a recompile, reviewed as a commit.
ansible-core
antsibull-docs>=2.28,<3
ansible-pygments
sphinx
sphinx-ansible-theme>=0.10
pdoc
pyyaml
